SUMMARY:Swing Happy Hour: Kerrytown Stompers
DESCRIPTION:Fri | Apr 10\n5:00 – 6:30pm | No Cover \n RESERVE TABLE  \n\nAbout the Artist\nThe Kerrytown Stompers are thrilled to return to the Blue Llama Jazz Club to bring Swingin’ “Hot Jazz”\, performed by an All-Star Sextet. Specializing in Early Jazz from 1917 to 1940\, you will hear\, see and feel the reason this music has become so important in American culture. This music is instantly uplifting and fun. Not to be missed! \nDave Kosmyna- cornetRay Heitger- clarinetChris Smith- tromboneChris Tabaczynski- bass saxophoneAlex Belhaj- guitarPete Siers- drums\, washboard \n\n RESERVE TABLE
